Third-party data in this directory and in explorer/explorer.json
================================================================

The following files contain the 150 questions, gold answers and evidence page
numbers of the FinanceBench open-source sample:

  results/generation.jsonl
  results/generation_with_similarity.jsonl
  explorer/explorer.json  (also served on the GitHub Pages results explorer)

Retrieval result files (retrieval_per_question.json) contain question ids,
question types and evidence page numbers from the same dataset.

Source:   FinanceBench, Patronus AI - https://github.com/patronus-ai/financebench
Paper:    Islam et al., "FinanceBench: A New Benchmark for Financial Question
          Answering", 2023, arXiv:2311.11944
License:  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
          (CC BY-NC 4.0), as listed on the dataset card at
          https://huggingface.co/datasets/PatronusAI/financebench
          Licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Changes made: evidence page numbers were converted from FinanceBench's 0-based
page index to 1-based page numbers (index + 1); the evidence text itself is not
included; each question is joined with this project's model outputs (answers,
LLM-judge verdicts, citation-check results).

These parts of the files are NOT covered by the MIT licence in LICENSE, which
applies to this project's code only. They may be used for non-commercial
purposes only, with attribution to Patronus AI as above.

The model outputs in these files (answers and judge verdicts) were generated by
DeepSeek (deepseek-v4-flash) through its API and are labelled as such.
